"[LSNFRDNA009](Liaison Fordina) Ambassador Gremus, we just received that "
"follow-up information from Goltin 7 we spoke of. It seems they want "
"additional information about several artifacts. Some of these have been "
"reported by stations in the area: Pangora, Nakor and Science-37."
