msgid "Any reports of artifacts near Pangora?"
msgstr "Irgendwelche Berichte über Artefakte in der Nähe von Pangora?"

#: scripts/scenario_16_deliver_ambassador_gremus.lua:2301
msgctxt "artifact-comms"
msgid ""
"Some freighters report seeing an artifact on approximate heading 135 from "
"Pangora."
msgstr ""
"Einige Frachter berichten von der Sichtung eines Artefakt, die Richtung "
